          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: அதிகபட்சம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அதிகபட்சம் — atikapaṭcam — \"at most; a maximum\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "போக்குவரத்தைப் பொறுத்து அதிகபட்சம் இரண்டு மணி நேரத்தில் திரும்பி வருவோம். pōkkuvarattaip poṟuttu atikapaṭcam iraṇṭu maṇi nērattil tirumpi varuvōm. Depending on the traffic, we will be back in two hours at most."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The pair of குறைந்தபட்சம், at least."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அதிகபட்சம் (atikapaṭcam) is built from Sanskrit adhika, \"additional, more\" (CDIAL 250), and pakṣa, \"a side, a wing\" (CDIAL 7627): the side of more."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
